{"lyrics":"[Chorus: Freejay]\n[00:18.90]I got homies on my line now\n[00:31.10]Ain't got the time now\n[00:32.88]Say I’m too focused on my mind, on my mind now\n[00:36.42]Worried 'bout those commas, ayy\n[00:39.20]Ask me how I'm doing, said I’m fine, yeah, I'm fine, yeah\n[00:43.20]I get those goosebumps every time, yeah\n[00:46.06]Yeah, all that drama, leave it to the side now, the side now\n[00:50.60]I get those goosebumps every time, yeah\n[00:53.54]Ayy, pull up off the lot like a full-drive now, drive\n[00:57.98]I get those goosebumps every time\n[Verse 1: Teddy Stax]\n[00:59.58]First verse, put 'em in a hearse\n[01:01.10]Lead y'all to the stars like I'm Captain Kirk\n[01:02.94]She so hurt, sayin' you a jerk\n[01:04.66]I did leave her, but she bought me a shirt\n[01:06.70]She slashed the tires, now she can't even skrt\n[01:08.80]OG plug me up from the start\n[01:10.52]Gave me a sticker so a young bool could park\n[01:12.38]Flipping for the bread, watch for the narcs\n[01:14.24]Fake coins, I ain't ever take a loss\n[01:16.00]Stay cold like my boy, Jack Frost\n[01:17.98]A1, yeah, I been had the sauce\n[01:19.78]Gonna run it back like Marshall Faulk\n[01:22.08]Now, I’m on that real talk\n[01:23.12]The deans around every corner\n[01:24.62]That’s why I'm a loner\n[01:25.80]But I still got a chip on my shoulder\n[01:27.38]If you think I’m not the best, wait 'till I get older\n[01:29.50]Solar, yeah, I'm in the stars\n[01:30.88]Hold up, wait, I'm just getting charged\n[01:32.74]Headphones blasting, duckin’ the guards\n[01:34.54]Golfin', no, no, they ain't up to par\n[01:36.42]My bad, 'cause I ain't ever do homework\n[01:38.44]But I still got the trail like a chauffeur\n[01:40.62]All that tough talk, ayy, what you finna do in the suburbs?\n[Verse 2: Juice WRLD]\n[01:43.58]Huh\n[01:43.82]Back in the day they would laugh at me, now I'm a rapping catastrophe\n[01:46.58]Bet all them teachers that gave me detentions, is mad at me, I wasn't serving 'em\n[01:49.86]I got so many 5 hours after working 9-5 to get 'em off\n[01:53.04]Brain started with a fire principal\n[01:54.92]No more pitstops with a pickcock, keep my hall passes in a Ziploc\n[01:58.62]Also, to all of the teachers who thinkin' they homework is funny, you ain't Chris Rock\n[02:02.38]Also, to all the freshmen in the wrong classroom, this ain't third block\n[02:06.02]All of you nappy-headed fro having, True Religion wearing, this ain't Boondocks\n[02:09.70]By the way, Coach Kruze for the record, you owe me a pair of tube socks\n[02:13.30]2017 senior, ayy\n[02:15.18]Next year, I cop the beamer, ayy\n[02:16.74]500 for a feature, ayy\n[02:18.86]Just to stunt up on my teacher, ayy\n[02:20.80]I remember I would freestyle at the pep rally by the bleachers, ayy\n[02:24.50]I remember lying to the nurse, yeah, I really had to fake a fever, ayy\n[Chorus: Freejay]\n[02:28.36]I got homies on my line now\n[02:36.70]Ain't got the time now\n[02:38.50]Say I'm too focused on my mind, on my mind now\n[02:41.96]Worried 'bout those commas, ayy\n[02:44.80]Ask me how I'm doing, said I'm fine, yeah, I'm fine, yeah\n[02:48.72]I get those goosebumps every time, yeah\n[02:51.66]Yeah, all that drama, leave it to the side now, the side now\n[02:56.12]I get those goosebumps every time, yeah\n[02:58.06]Ayy, pull up off the lot like a full-drive now, drive\n[03:00.96]I get those goosebumps every time\n[Verse 3: Freejay]\n[03:04.46]I be moving through the scenes\n[03:05.52]Clip is the king and you know that\n[03:06.78]Campaign the strongest\n[03:07.72]Can't hand me loses\n[03:08.64]Wins come regardless\n[03:09.66]Feelin' like a young Nick Holmes, man, can't nobody stop me\n[03:11.80]It's facts, the whole time my lines a gold mine you dig deep\n[03:14.26]Since a freshman, I been trying to reach 6 feet\n[03:16.10]Never really made it, but the confidence aided now I'm feeling like KD (I mean, really G)\n[03:19.84]Only five hour I'm taking is for my energy level, my tendencies settle the rest\n[03:22.88]Want to act like top flight security when really they just sit at a desk\n[03:25.48]Until they feel the need to make an arrest, It's amazing\n[03:27.66]Four years later and we finally made it the rest look\n[03:30.10]We OKC, I resemble Westbrook\n[03:31.92]MVP, my DNA on TNT, we going live like VTV with it for mine, ayy\n[03:36.04]I'ma hit them with it every line, ayy\n[03:38.30]Used to get in trouble always cutting in the line\n[03:40.10]Now I'm never late whole world on time and I'm never going back like reverse\n[03:43.34]Took me like a day to get done with the verse\n[03:45.22]I be so in tune feel the spin of the earth\n[04:06.20]Never miss it's a gift man and I can merch\n[04:17.38]Free","words":[[18.9,18.9,"I"],[28.72,28.92,"got"],[29.0,29.46,"homies"],[29.56,29.58,"on"],[29.66,29.68,"my"],[29.82,30.02,"line"],[30.34,30.56,"now"],[31.1,31.22,"Ain't"],[31.28,31.48,"got"],[31.72,31.88,"the"],[31.96,32.18,"time"],[32.22,32.42,"now"],[32.88,33.12,"Say"],[33.2,33.26,"I’m"],[33.34,33.48,"too"],[33.56,34.04,"focused"],[34.12,34.18,"on"],[34.24,34.26,"my"],[34.48,34.98,"mind,"],[35.06,35.1,"on"],[35.18,35.2,"my"],[35.4,35.78,"mind"],[35.88,36.3,"now"],[36.42,36.7,"Worried"],[36.74,36.94,"'bout"],[37.02,37.24,"those"],[37.3,37.94,"commas,"],[38.76,39.14,"ayy"],[39.2,39.34,"Ask"],[39.4,39.46,"me"],[39.58,39.82,"how"],[39.9,39.96,"I'm"],[40.04,40.4,"doing,"],[40.5,40.74,"said"],[40.8,40.84,"I’m"],[40.96,41.36,"fine,"],[41.4,42.12,"yeah,"],[42.16,42.24,"I'm"],[42.34,42.76,"fine,"],[42.8,43.16,"yeah"],[43.2,43.2,"I"],[43.26,43.4,"get"],[43.48,43.7,"those"],[43.74,44.16,"goosebumps"],[44.26,44.58,"every"],[44.62,45.08,"time,"],[45.12,45.24,"yeah"],[46.06,46.56,"Yeah,"],[46.6,46.74,"all"],[46.78,46.92,"that"],[46.96,47.26,"drama,"],[47.46,47.7,"leave"],[47.74,47.82,"it"],[47.86,47.88,"to"],[47.92,48.04,"the"],[48.34,48.7,"side"],[48.82,49.08,"now,"],[49.12,49.56,"the"],[49.74,50.08,"side"],[50.2,50.4,"now"],[50.6,50.6,"I"],[50.66,50.78,"get"],[50.9,51.1,"those"],[51.14,51.58,"gooseb